WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:02.505
The first meeting with Giannis Farazis

2
00:00:02.505 --> 00:00:04.257
takes about forty-five minutes.

3
00:00:04.502 --> 00:00:06.858
No application or policy is signed.

4
00:00:07.044 --> 00:00:09.249
It happens at the office in Nicosia,

5
00:00:09.436 --> 00:00:13.603
by video call or by phone, in Greek or English.

6
00:00:14.703 --> 00:00:18.638
You talk about what you want to protect, what you already have,

7
00:00:18.825 --> 00:00:22.237
such as insurance, a provident fund and savings,

8
00:00:22.296 --> 00:00:25.965
where the gaps or overlaps are, and what monthly amount

9
00:00:25.965 --> 00:00:30.085
is sensible for you, so that it does not become a burden.

10
00:00:31.185 --> 00:00:32.914
Bring whatever you find easily:

11
00:00:33.159 --> 00:00:38.069
the policies you have, for a loan the balance, term and instalment,

12
00:00:38.255 --> 00:00:41.854
a rough income and main costs, and your questions written down.

13
00:00:42.156 --> 00:00:45.406
By video call, simply have them next to you.

14
00:00:46.506 --> 00:00:49.268
You do not need medical files or test results,

15
00:00:49.292 --> 00:00:51.602
bank account or card numbers, or originals:

16
00:00:51.974 --> 00:00:54.876
copies or a photo on your phone are enough.

17
00:00:55.976 --> 00:00:58.309
After the meeting you decide whether to go on.

18
00:00:58.611 --> 00:01:01.735
If you do, a proposal is prepared in plain words,

19
00:01:01.735 --> 00:01:05.925
which you can take with you and think about for as long as you need.

20
00:01:07.025 --> 00:01:09.660
Book an appointment on farazisgiannis.com,

21
00:01:09.660 --> 00:01:12.283
choosing a day and time from the real free times.
